OL,3,GNEWSAResidents fear loss of green space
OL,4,Ain housing plan                        
OL,6,FCampaigners say they fear a "much-loved
OL,7,Fgreen space" will be destroyed if the  
OL,8,Fcreation of an access road to a new    
OL,9,Fhousing development is approved.       
OL,11,FResidents living in West Hunsbury,     
OL,12,FNorthampton, say they support the      
OL,13,Fbuilding of new homes but oppose plans 
OL,14,Fto build an access road through the    
OL,15,Fland.                                  
OL,17,FDeveloper Bellway Homes has submitted a
OL,18,Fplanning application to West           
OL,19,FNorthamptonshire Council to build 92   
OL,20,Fproperties, using the green space to   
OL,21,Fprovide access to the site.            
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
