OL,3,GNEWSAResidents fear loss of green space
OL,4,Ain housing plan                        
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Reform UK-led West  
OL,7,FNorthamptonshire Council said the      
OL,8,Fapplication was going through the      
OL,9,F"normal planning process" and people   
OL,10,Fwould be invited to comment on it in   
OL,11,FDecember.                              
